### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### Actualizar empresa (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/empresas/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tax_id": "900123456-1",
  "legal_name": "TransMovil Actualizada S.A.S",
  "primary_contact": "Maria Lopez",
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Actualizar empresa parcial (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/empresas/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "primary_contact": "Carlos Gomez"
}
